    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing... i've been \"allowing the feeling\" for months. it's not just a phase anymore. it's like i've completed the arc of my life and there's nothing left to write. it feels like the most natural thing in the world to just... stop. to let the story end because there's no more plot. isn't there a certain kind of peace in just accepting that the well is dry?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
